{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And Moses said, See.</b> As if saying: See the trouble that I stand in. And now I shall state the grammatical analysis of the pericope:" "The Gaon [Saadia] said: \"I have known you\" is like \"I have honored you.\" This is not correct, for after it is \"that I may know you,\" just as \"you have known me.\""], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:02.774019004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}